{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🌙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知公演、2日間ありがとうございました！　とても楽しかったです〜！　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SP4AHZ6EFH84BGKFFJ0SV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　どんどん短くなっていく。笑　　　　そして、愛知公演の初日の日に、『Dead End』のMVが解禁されました✨　　みなさま。もう見てくださいましたかー？　　　是非✨　https://youtu.be/FEfJB32wvsk　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SP5EE4GKRVRV33VHGT2K5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SP6FEE1GKHGEMGCR07D8S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SP7HA47C8GNQWPADTB7G4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SP8N5P3TJM61PWK6G7JBE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　　　最後のシーンの草原の日、とても風が強くて、、、コートを投げたらびゅーーーーーんと飛んでいってる。笑　　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SP9NQEZABJWAP9GE3WZ89","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　愛知で、味噌煮込みうどんとなが餅をお土産に買いました。いえい。🤍　　　　また次、大阪でお会いしましょう〜👋　　　　またね　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SPANBXP1M81003N2H782H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SPBVNB4Q0FJDHYG2WNQRV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　これは２日目の写真だよ☺️　　　　　　あおい　　　　             "}],"source":"archive"}